        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lo̱k Thuk Duëli caam kɛ Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm wä kä Cɛ-kɛm, kɛ ɣöö ci thuk duëli kuec caam ben thi̱n kɛ ɣöö ba wä jak kä kuäär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca liŋ ɛ Ya-rɔ-baam gat Nɛ-bat (kɛ ɣöö ŋotdɛ kä I-jëp, guäth ëë cɛ rɔ bar thi̱n kɛ kuäär ni Thɔ-lo-mon), cuɛ luny jɔk kä I-jëp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛ Ya-rɔ-baam jäk kä raan, kä jɛn kɛnɛ thuk duëli kuec caam diaal, cu kɛ ben kä Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm, kä cua jɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ci guur kɔ ciɛŋ ɛ bɛc ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ täämɛ ku ciaŋ guur ɛ bɛc bɛc ɛmɛ woc kä kɔ, ba̱kɔ ji̱ lät ikä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ loc i̱, “Luɔ̱nyɛ kä ɣä kɛ kɔr ni̱ni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k.” Kä cu naath jiɛɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kuäär ni Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm ruac wä thiec kä nɛy tin di̱t tëë la luëëk gua̱n ni Thɔ-lo-mon, wëë i̱, “Ɛŋu mi dërɛ la̱rä mi dëë wä luɔ̱c nɛy ti̱ti̱?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Mi wi̱i̱ lät agɔaa kɛ kɛn nɛy ti̱ti̱ a wi̱i̱ lo̱ckiɛn jak kä tɛth, kä bikɛ la̱t ruac mi gɔaa, ba ji̱ lätikä amäni cäŋ kɛl.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cuɛ luek nɛɛni tin di̱t lo̱k, cuɛ wä nhɔk ni luek ŋuɛ̈tni tin pith kɛɛl kɛ jɛ kä ci cuɔ̱ŋ nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛŋu mi dëë yɛn ɛ lar, mi dënɛ loc ni nɛy ti ca ɣä jiök ti i̱, ‘Woc ciaŋ ɛ bɛc bɛc ɛ ci guur ɛ ka̱m kɔ mi?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ŋuɛ̈tni jɛ jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn min bi la̱r kɛn nɛy tin ca ji̱ jiök i̱, ‘Ci guur kɔ moc lät ti bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈c, duundɛ ɣöö kuɛ lɛ woc kä kɔ.’ Jio̱k nikɛ i̱, ‘Yiatdä min tɔt dho̱k ni jɛn kä juäk gua̱a̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ mi ci gua̱a̱r yɛ ka̱m lät ti bɛ̈c bɛ̈ɛ̈c, kä ɣän bäkɛ jak kä bɛc ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Ci gua̱a̱r yɛ duäc kɛ cuëëc ɣɔ̱ɔ̱k, kä ɣän bä yɛ duäc kɛ waat loorä.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Ya-rɔ-baam kɛnɛ nɛy diaal ben kä kuäär ni Rɛ-ɣɛ̈-bɔm, kɛ diɔ̱ɔ̱k ni̱ni ce̱tkɛ mëë cɛ lar i̱, “Luɔ̱nyɛ kä ɣä kɛ diɔ̱ɔ̱k ni̱ni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuäär ɛ loc a jiäk, cuɛ luek di̱tni min ca la̱r jɛ lo̱k, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cuɛ ruac kɛ kɛ ce̱tkɛ ruac ŋuɛ̈tni wëë i̱, “Ci gua̱a̱r yɛ ciɛŋ ɛ bɛc, duundɛ ɣöö bä rep ni bɛ̈cdɛ. Kä gua̱a̱r cɛ yɛ duäc kɛ cuëëc ɣɔ̱ɔ̱k, kä ɣän bä yɛ duäc kɛ waat loorä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ /ken kuäär ruac nath liŋ. Kɛ ɣöö bi ruac Kuɔth Nhial ni Kuoth, mëë lätdɛ Ya-rɔ-baam gat Nɛ-bat kɛ thok go̱kä ni Ä-ɣi-yaa raan Cilo a thuɔ̱k.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci thuk duëli kuec caam ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö /ken kuäär kɛ liŋ, cukɛ jɛ loc i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
